I don't think so!

338
00:13:51,720 --> 00:13:54,100
是啊 我很喜欢她的电影
Yeah. Yeah. I like her movies.

339
00:13:54,280 --> 00:13:57,140
她是个出色的女人 求求你 别闹了吧
She's every woman. Come on. Let's not fight.

340
00:13:57,200 --> 00:14:01,207
坐下来 像两个不成熟的成年人那样谈谈吧
Let's just discuss this like two un-immature adults.

341
00:14:06,600 --> 00:14:08,340
你好 帕特森太太
Hello? Mrs. Patterson.

342
00:14:08,460 --> 00:14:09,900
