Hi. I've been waiting for your call.

343
00:14:10,360 --> 00:14:13,480
嗯 我们可不可以再仔细谈一谈
Yeah. Uh, is there any chance that maybe we could talk a little bit-

344
00:14:13,534 --> 00:14:15,766
没没没 挺好的 真挺好的
No, no, no, no. Now's perfect. That's fine.

345
00:14:15,820 --> 00:14:19,000
不好意思 我这边吵 等我把办公室门关上
I'm sorry. I couldn't hear you. Let me just close my office door.

346
00:14:19,780 --> 00:14:22,060
好了 能听清了
There we go. Much, much better.

347
00:14:25,144 --> 00:14:28,279
我们再来回顾一下车祸的情形吧
Okay. Maybe, uh, we should go over the accident one more time.

348
00:14:28,340 --> 00:14:31,820
一丝不"狗"地分析 你真是个好律师啊
Put the dogs on a row. You're such a good lawyer.

349
00:14:31,878 --> 00:14:33,180
我就是想确保
Uh, I just wanna make sure

350
00:14:33,180 --> 00:14:35,540
一定要搞清楚真实的情况
we're 100% clear on exactly what happened.

351
00:14:35,800 --> 00:14:37,900
已经很清楚了啊 我跟你说了啊
Oh, we're clear. I told you.

352
00:14:38,560 --> 00:14:40,240
怎么 你不信我吗
What? You don't believe me?

353
00:14:41,460 --> 00:14:43,140
没 没 我只是
No, no. I just-

354
00:14:43,480 --> 00:14:45,800
你知道 有时候会漏掉一些细节嘛
You know, sometimes you can forget tiny details.

355
00:14:45,920 --> 00:14:49,640
比如 有没有可能 是你开太快了
Like, is it possible, maybe, uh, you were driving too fast?

356
00:14:49,960 --> 00:14:52,100
-谁说我开太快了 -对 谁说的
-Who said I was driving fast? -Yeah, who?

357
00:14:52,961 --> 00:14:55,040
我看着街上
I just-I'm looking at the street,

358
00:14:55,120 --> 00:14:57,280
就想 如果你开得很快的话
and I'm thinking if you were driving a little fast,

359
00:14:57,280 --> 00:14:58,200
你就有可能
it's possible that maybe you

360
00:14:58,200 --> 00:15:00,600
-没看见那车 -你也跟他们一样
- didn't see the car - You're like everyone else, huh?

361
00:15:01,240 --> 00:15:02,640
一切都是我们拉丁人的错
You blame the Latino driver.

362
