你们老家不是所有司机都是拉丁司机吗
Where you come from, isn't everybody a Latino driver?

364
00:15:07,901 --> 00:15:11,173
-曼尼 你跟他说 -没法说啊 我吃蛋糕呢
- Manny, tell him. - I can't 'cause I have a cupcake in my mouth.

365
00:15:11,240 --> 00:15:13,180
得了吧 别拿蛋糕当挡箭牌
Oh, come on. Don't blame your cupcake.

366
00:15:13,560 --> 00:15:15,820
怎么 你也觉得是我的错吗
What? You think I'm guilty too?

367
00:15:15,894 --> 00:15:17,956
-没啦 -得
- No. - Fine.

368
