I don't need you as a lawyer anymore.

369
00:15:19,700 --> 00:15:23,120
你俩不是觉得我是个烂司机吗
And if you two think I'm such a bad driver,

370
00:15:23,440 --> 00:15:25,000
你们走回家好了
you're safer walking home.

371
00:15:25,058 --> 00:15:26,034
拜拜
Chao.

372
00:15:28,800 --> 00:15:31,640
-就这儿了 -真好
- Here it is. - It's really cute.

373
00:15:31,720 --> 00:15:33,520
嗯 我们都很以此为豪呢
Yeah. We're pretty proud of it.

374
