野格酒 老爸说它可以让女生更容易亲
Jegermeister. Dad says it makes girls easier to kiss.

388
00:16:11,220 --> 00:16:13,520
-那地毯是怎么回事 -出了点小意外
- What happened to the rug? - I had an accident.

389
00:16:13,920 --> 00:16:15,180
好吧 艾丽克斯 你又在干嘛
Okay. Alex, what are you doing?

390
00:16:15,180 --> 00:16:17,219
我在追杀一只耗子
I'm trying to kill a rat.

391
00:16:17,219 --> 00:16:18,769
好吧
Okay

392
00:16:18,832 --> 00:16:21,057
莎伦在帮我给你挑生日礼物
Sharon was helping me buy you a birthday present.

393
00:16:21,120 --> 00:16:23,000
你不明白吗 我爱的是你的屁股蛋蛋
Don't you get it? I love your ass.

394
00:16:23,067 --> 00:16:26,619
那个...我 我快迟了 得走了
I-You know, I-I-I'm late and I should go.

395
00:16:26,619 --> 00:16:28,063
-我知道 我知道 -嗯
-I know. I know. -Yeah.

396
