413
00:17:11,140 --> 00:17:11,980
-嗯 -哇
- Yeah. - Wow!

414
00:17:12,220 --> 00:17:14,580
-你真漂亮 -谢谢
- You look fantastic. - Thank you.

415
00:17:14,720 --> 00:17:16,760
