你能承认 挺好的
Well, I'm glad you can admit that, Gloria.

462
00:19:23,580 --> 00:19:26,423
但我还是想让你当我的律师 米奇
But I'm still gonna need you as my lawyer, Mitch.

463
00:19:26,423 --> 00:19:28,168
-为什么 -因为眼前的惨剧
-Why? -Because this one

464
00:19:28,220 --> 00:19:32,360
完全不关我的事 我保证
It was not my fault, I promise you.

465
00:19:33,340 --> 00:19:34,520
原来那巨响是这个啊
That's what that sound was.

466
00:19:34,760 --> 00:19:36,200
都是这蛋糕招牌的错
It was the big cupcake.

467
00:19:37,620 --> 00:19:39,880
简直难以置信 老妈疯了
That was unreal. Mom was crazy.

468
00:19:40,680 --> 00:19:41,420
我好怕怕
I'm scared.

469
00:19:41,920 --> 00:19:45,680
听着 我了解你妈这个人 她没事的
Look. I know your mom pretty well. She's fine.

470
