爱死他们了
Never loved 'em more.

492
00:20:47,560 --> 00:20:49,680
为毛瓦莱丽就看不到他们的这一面呢
Why the hell couldn't Valerie have seen them like that?

493
00:21:01,880 --> 00:21:02,720
嘿 迪兰
Hey, Dylan.

494
00:21:03,120 --> 00:21:03,920
你好 邓菲先生
Hey, Mr. Dunphy.

